<mxfile host="65bd71144e">
    <diagram id="N2kx-6v2A2Kcj-CnpEVP" name="Page-1">
        <mxGraphModel dx="6589" dy="555" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
            <root>
                <mxCell id="0"/>
                <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
                <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;ได้เพิ่ม Activate Bar (Execution Specification) ลงใน Sequence Diagram ให้เรียบร้อยครับ โดยใช้คำสั่ง activate และ deactivate ตามวงจรการทำงาน (Lifecycle) ของแต่ละ Object เพื่อให้เห็นชัดเจนว่าแต่ละส่วนเริ่มและหยุดประมวลผลตอนไหนครับ\nคุณสามารถคัดลอกโค้ดด้านล่างนี้ไปใช้งานใน VS Code หรือ PlantUML Web ได้เลยครับ\n@startuml\nautonumber\nactor Manager\nboundary UI\ncontrol PlanController\nentity Database\ncontrol WeatherService\ncontrol CalcService\nactor Owner\n\nManager -&gt; UI: Select \&quot;Draft and present seasonal plan\&quot;\nactivate UI\nUI -&gt; PlanController: getSeasonalPlans()\nactivate PlanController\nPlanController -&gt; Database: fetchPlans()\nactivate Database\nDatabase --&gt; PlanController: plansData\ndeactivate Database\nPlanController --&gt; UI: Display existing plans &amp; New Plan button\ndeactivate PlanController\ndeactivate UI\n\nManager -&gt; UI: Select \&quot;Create new seasonal plan\&quot;\nactivate UI\nUI -&gt; PlanController: getOwnerConstraints()\nactivate PlanController\nPlanController -&gt; Database: fetchProductionGoalAndBudget()\nactivate Database\nDatabase --&gt; PlanController: constraintsData\ndeactivate Database\nPlanController --&gt; UI: Display form, production goal, budget limit\ndeactivate PlanController\ndeactivate UI\n\ngroup SubFlow A: Define Plan Details\n    Manager -&gt; UI: Enter details (year, season, plot, variety, activities, resources)\n    activate UI\n    deactivate UI\nend\n\ngroup SubFlow B: Fetch Weather Forecast\n    UI -&gt; PlanController: requestWeatherData(dateRange)\n    activate UI\n    activate PlanController\n    PlanController -&gt; WeatherService: fetchWeatherForecast()\n    activate WeatherService\n    \n    alt Exceptional Flow B: API Error\n        WeatherService --&gt; PlanController: Connection Error\n        deactivate WeatherService\n        PlanController --&gt; UI: Display weather connection error\n        deactivate PlanController\n        UI --&gt; Manager: Prompt to retry / save draft / cancel\n        deactivate UI\n    else Normal Flow\n        WeatherService --&gt; PlanController: weatherData\n        deactivate WeatherService\n        PlanController --&gt; UI: Display weather data\n        deactivate PlanController\n        deactivate UI\n        \n        Manager -&gt; UI: Adjust schedule (if necessary)\n        activate UI\n        deactivate UI\n    end\nend\n\ngroup SubFlow C: Calculate Resource and Budget\n    UI -&gt; PlanController: calculateBudget(resources)\n    activate UI\n    activate PlanController\n    PlanController -&gt; CalcService: calculate()\n    activate CalcService\n    CalcService -&gt; Database: getStandardPrices()\n    activate Database\n    \n    alt Exceptional Flow C: Missing Price Data\n        Database --&gt; CalcService: Missing standard prices\n        deactivate Database\n        CalcService --&gt; PlanController: Error (Data Missing)\n        deactivate CalcService\n        PlanController --&gt; UI: Display missing resource data\n        deactivate PlanController\n        UI --&gt; Manager: Notify submission disabled\n        deactivate UI\n    else Normal Flow\n        Database --&gt; CalcService: pricesData\n        deactivate Database\n        CalcService --&gt; PlanController: totalBudget\n        deactivate CalcService\n        PlanController --&gt; UI: Display plan details, weather, and budget\n        deactivate PlanController\n        deactivate UI\n    end\nend\n\nopt Extend: Over-budget justification (Alternate Flow B)\n    PlanController -&gt; PlanController: Check Budget &gt; Framework\n    activate PlanController\n    PlanController --&gt; UI: Alert: Budget exceeds limit\n    deactivate PlanController\n    \n    activate UI\n    UI --&gt; Manager: Alert: Budget exceeds limit\n    deactivate UI\n    \n    Manager -&gt; UI: Provide justification for over-budget\n    activate UI\n    deactivate UI\nend\n\nManager -&gt; UI: Review and select Action (Submit / Draft / Cancel / Edit)\n\nalt Alternate Flow D: Cancel Plan Creation\n    Manager -&gt; UI: Click Cancel\n    activate UI\n    UI --&gt; Manager: Confirm cancellation?\n    Manager -&gt; UI: Confirm\n    UI -&gt; UI: Return to plan list page\n    deactivate UI\n    \nelse Alternate Flow C: Edit Plan Before Submission\n    Manager -&gt; UI: Click Edit\n    activate UI\n    UI -&gt; Manager: Display existing data for editing (Loop back)\n    deactivate UI\n    \nelse Alternate Flow A: Save as Draft\n    Manager -&gt; UI: Click Save Draft\n    activate UI\n    UI -&gt; PlanController: savePlan(status=\&quot;Draft\&quot;)\n    activate PlanController\n    PlanController -&gt; Database: insertData()\n    activate Database\n    Database --&gt; PlanController: Success\n    deactivate Database\n    PlanController --&gt; UI: Display \&quot;Draft saved successfully\&quot;\n    deactivate PlanController\n    deactivate UI\n    \nelse Normal Flow: Confirm Submission\n    Manager -&gt; UI: Click Submit Plan\n    activate UI\n    UI -&gt; PlanController: submitPlan(planDetails)\n    activate PlanController\n    \n    PlanController -&gt; PlanController: validateData()\n    activate PlanController\n    deactivate PlanController\n    \n    alt Exceptional Flow A: Incomplete/Incorrect Data\n        PlanController --&gt; UI: Validation Error\n        UI --&gt; Manager: Highlight data to correct\n    else Data Valid\n        PlanController -&gt; Database: savePlan(status=\&quot;Pending Approval\&quot;)\n        activate Database\n        \n        alt Exceptional Flow D: Database Error\n            Database --&gt; PlanController: Save Failed\n            deactivate Database\n            PlanController --&gt; UI: Display system error message\n        else Save Success\n            Database --&gt; PlanController: Save Success\n            deactivate Database\n            PlanController -&gt; Owner: Notify / Submit plan for review\n            PlanController --&gt; UI: return Success Status\n            UI --&gt; Manager: Display \&quot;Plan submitted successfully\&quot;\n        end\n    end\n    deactivate PlanController\n    deactivate UI\nend\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="2">
